      "section_title": null,
      "chunk_type": "worked_example",
      "content_markdown": "Solution : $\\frac{x-y}{xy} + \\frac{y-z}{yz} - \\frac{z-x}{zx}$ \n\n$= \\frac{(x-y) \\times z + (y-z) \\times x - (z-x) \\times y}{xyz}$ \n\n$= \\frac{zx - yz + xy - zx - yz + xy}{xyz}$ \n\n$= \\frac{2xy - 2yz}{xyz} = \\frac{2y(x-z)}{xyz} = \\frac{2(x-z)}{xz}$",
